    "summary": "Jeremiah, speaking for Judah, laments the calamity but trusts in the Lord and prays for deliverance.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "I am the man that hath seen affliction by the rod of his wrath.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 2,
            "end": 4
          },
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 17
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:1",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath led me, and brought me into darkness, but not into light.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 35
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 58
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:2",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Surely against me is he turned; he turneth his hand against me all the day.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 62
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:3",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "My flesh and my skin hath he made old; he hath broken my bones.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:4",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath builded against me, and compassed me with gall and travail.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:5",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath set me in dark places, as they that be dead of old.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:6",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath hedged me about, that I cannot get out: he hath made my chain heavy.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "Hosea 2:6; D&C 122:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Hosea 2:6; D&C 122:7.",
            "prettyString": "Hosea 2:6; D&C 122:7",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "hosea",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
                    "end": 2,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 6,
                        "end": 6
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "doctrineandcovenants",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 122,
                    "end": 122,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 7,
                        "end": 7
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:7",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Also when I cry and shout, he shutteth out my prayer.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:8",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath inclosed my ways with hewn stone, he hath made my paths crooked.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:9",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "He was unto me as a bear lying in wait, and as a lion in secret places.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 6
          },
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 17
          },
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:10",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath turned aside my ways, and pulled me in pieces: he hath made me desolate.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:11",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath bent his bow, and set me as a mark for the arrow.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:12",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath caused the arrows of his quiver to enter into my reins.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:13",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "I was a derision to all my people; and their song all the day.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Jer. 20:7 (7–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:14",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath filled me with bitterness, he hath made me drunken with wormwood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:15",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "He hath also broken my teeth with gravel stones, he hath covered me with ashes.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:16",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou hast removed my soul far off from peace: I forgat prosperity.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:17",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And I said, My strength and my hope is perished from the Lord:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:18",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Remembering mine affliction and my misery, the wormwood and the gall.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:19",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "My soul hath them still in remembrance, and is humbled in me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 17
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:20",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "This I recall to my mind, therefore have I hope.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:21",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "It is of the Lord’s mercies that we are not consumed, because his compassions fail not.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 8
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:22",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "They are new every morning: great is thy faithfulness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 36
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:23",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 23
      },
