        "reference": "Lamentations 3:54",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 54
      },
      {
        "text": "I called upon thy name, O Lord, out of the low dungeon.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 55,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:55",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 55
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast heard my voice: hide not thine ear at my breathing, at my cry.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 56,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 3:56",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 56
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou drewest near in the day that I called upon thee: thou saidst, Fear not.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "D&C 88:63 (62–63)."
